"you going?  Dammit, we're backing out?  Fine.  I'll make sure everyone "
"knows.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "isherwood_mission_damage_flee_message"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/npc_eocs/isherwood_barry_rescue_eocs.json
