"You hear a horn honk, and one of the Isherwoods calling out from their "
"truck.  \"We're swarmed out here!  We're going to have to head back and "
"regroup!\"  The horn bleats again, and there's a sound of an engine revving,"
" followed by the fleshy 'smack' of something large hitting a windshield."
msgstr ""

