#. BLR"
#. ~ Description of variant "Browning BLR" of item "BLR lever-action hunting
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
msgid ""
"The Browning BLR is notable for being a lever-action rifle, chambered in "
"calibers with spitzer bullets.  This is unusual for lever-actions, as a "
"spitzer bullet risks setting off other cartridges in a typical tube "
"magazine.  The BLR gets around this issue by utilizing box magazines "
"instead, making it quite unique among other lever-action rifles.  This one "
"is chambered for 30-06."
msgstr ""

