#. ~ Description of variant "AKM" of item "AKM rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/762.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"Arguably the most mass-produced firearm ever made, the AKM has cemented "
"itself in history, and a few country flags.  Designed after WW2, it was "
"meant to replace the PPSh-41's role, but soon became the main infantry "
"rifle.  While many believe it is a copy of the German StG-44, it more "
"resembles an M1 Garand in operation.  Despite it's age, it still sees plenty"
" of use in conflicts today."
msgstr ""

