#. ~ Description of monster "staticskin frog"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"Bioluminescent trails trace through the dark speckled patterns on this "
"oversized frog's skin.  What would be cleanly defined spots on another frog,"
" are instead fragmented collages of gray and black pigment over pale skin.  "
"Its vestigial gills have grown into something else.  You can see them "
"bulging the flesh under its mouth."
msgstr ""

