#. ~ Description of monster "Kevlar zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"This zombie dons a uniform with heavy, bulletproof materials sewn in.  "
"Peculiarly, the uniform seems to have fused to its skin in certain places, "
"its flesh gripping the edges of its gear as though the body were trying to "
"absorb it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
