"Compared to the cyborgs you've seen elsewhere, this one looks almost "
"inverted.  Its body is made of smooth, segmented, paper-thin metallic "
"plates; fleshy protrusions and bits of bone jut from components growing off "
"this base frame.  It moves wildly, but not like a zombie; more like a "
"machine gone haywire."
msgstr ""

