msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"We got to my buddy's ranch, but the <freaking> g-men had been there first.  "
"It was all boarded up and there was a police barricade out front.  One of "
"those <freaking> turrets… shot Buck.  Almost got me too.  I managed to get "
"my pup… get him outta there, that… it wasn't easy, had to use a police car "
