#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/Lapin_01.json
msgid ""
"Actually, yeah.  It's a long shot but we could follow it if you like.  I ran"
" into another survivor once - don't think she made it, she was heading to a "
"nearby mall, and that place was overrun.  She mentioned seeing a guy taking "
"care of his cabin in the woods though.  Said she thought about checking on "
"him, but that was when things were all going nuts, and she decided against "
"it.  I got some directions and never followed through on it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/Lapin_01.json
msgid "Let's see how to get there and go check on the guy."
msgstr ""

