#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
msgid ""
"A handful of edible and heavily genemoded grubs, each only slightly thinner than your thumb.  Engineered in the wake of the XXII century to feed an overpopulated Earth and its fledgling colonies these are a sturdy, easily grown and scalable crop.\n"
