msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Slowfall)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Slowfall.  Some people become mages due to a dream, or a "
"goal they want to pursue, but for you it was the memory of falling down the "
"stairs as a child and breaking your leg.  With your magic you could jump off"
" a roof and it was no more dangerous than jumping off a low stone wall, and "
"that's been pretty useful for some of the situations you've found yourself "
"in since the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

