msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Faerie Fire.  Maybe it wasn't a great use of your time, but "
"it was fun at parties and one time when your cat ran off it made it very "
"easy to find her.  Since the Cataclysm, though, your magical powers have "
"become much more useful."
msgstr ""

