#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
msgid ""
"As you nearly complete the spell, you stop in your tracks.  There's "
"something odd about the ground below you, and sinking into it would be too "
"dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH_2"
