"A reference book for the practical use of magic in healing the sort of "
"wounds that are likely to occur at home: burns from cooking, scraped knees, "
"cuts from knives, bruises, colds and the flu, and so on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
