#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
msgid ""
"As you come out of the darkness and the cold and see the surface, you feel a"
" sudden wrenching sensation.  Pain washes over your entire body as your "
"vision goes red, and the air burns as you take in a ragged breath.  The "
"powers behind your situation are not happy at your attempt to circumvent "
"their rules."
msgstr ""

