"Graceful and resembling herons but stretched to the size of a horse, the "
"aenóren (\"white-striders\" in Brocéliandean) were domesticated by the elves"
" millennia ago.  While not useful as draft beasts, they retained popularity "
"as courier or racing mounts due to their speed, at least until the invention"
" of automobiles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Feed message of monster "aenor"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/domestic.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to like you!  It trills a few notes and lowers its head, "
"allowing you to pet it."
msgstr ""

