msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and "
"now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You've "
"suffered injuries that should have killed you multiple times over by now and"
" recovered in days every time.  You've broken your leg twice, your arm once,"
" drank bad water that had you puking your guts out, nearly been disemboweled"
" by some mutated thing…every single time, your powers kept you going.  "
"Hopefully they'll see you through to the very end of all this."
