#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Holding their head in their hands, they barely seem aware of the world "
"around them, but they still try to escape the zombies.  Looking at them, you"
" feel an eerie sensation like fingers scratching at your mind."
msgstr ""

