#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Temporal Misadventure" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/scenario.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"During the Cataclysmic portal storms, you and several other people were lost"
" trying to escape the monsters attacking you.  Eventually, something caught "
"up, and as your fellows started turning into frozen statues you ran straight"
" into what should have been open air.  The pain of that impact was nothing "
"compared to the knife you suddenly found stabbed into your torso.  The most "
"you saw of your attacker was a quick blur before everything suddenly "
"changed.  Snow covers the ground, the sun has set, you are freezing cold, "
"and the knife is still stuck in your torso.  However, you've gained a "
"dramatic new sense of time, and what is definitely the beginning of the "
"ability to manipulate it.  Even beyond the knife and the winter you never "
"thought you'd have to prepare for, your new powers tell you that there is "
"much more wrong with you than is immediately apparent.  Hopefully you can "
"use your skills and powers to survive both your new condition and every "
"other horror of the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

