#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid ""
"XEDRA Operative, Department of Extra-Normal Capabilities, SATOR Division"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "XEDRA Operative, Department of Extra-Normal
#. Capabilities, SATOR Division" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You joined XEDRA during the years leading up to the Cataclysm, and they told"
" you that you fit the profile of a SATOR agent.  At the time you had no idea"
" what they meant, and they gave you a couple days to process when you "
"learned that magic was real, the enemies of the United States possessed it, "
"and they wanted you to learn it too.  When they sat you down and had you "
"practice writing letters into patterns for days on end you wondered if you "
"had made a mistake, but when one of those squares let you summon a loaf of "
"bread out of thin air for lunch, you changed your tune pretty quickly."
msgstr ""

