#. ~ Description of MOD "Aftershock: Exoplanet"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"In a fateful instant, the dream of interstellar civilization was shattered in what became known as The Discontinuity, and billions were consigned to death in the far reaches of the Orion Arm.  Three hundred years later, the survivors still eke out a meager existence within the ruins of their once-great civilization, scavenging and fighting for scraps of technology they can barely understand.\n"
"\n"
"You are one of these countless scavengers, come to exploit the frozen ruins of Salus IV for your own benefit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Scavenger's Frontier" for male
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The Cryosleeper's slow approach allows the display of Salus IV in all its "
"forms: a fiery marble against interstellar darkness, a silver-white mirror, "
"and finally, a world of glaciers split by the thin ruins of an equatorial "
"metroplex.  Before long, Port Augustmoon's ancient hull comes to obstruct "
"most the viewport, and the ship's computer announces that it is time to "
"disembark."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Scavenger's Frontier" for female
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The Cryosleeper's slow approach allows the display of Salus IV in all its "
"forms: a fiery marble against interstellar darkness, a silver-white mirror, "
"and finally, a world of glaciers split by the thin ruins of an equatorial "
"metroplex.  Before long, Port Augustmoon's ancient hull comes to obstruct "
"most the viewport, and the ship's computer announces that it is time to "
"disembark."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "One Last Dance on the Ice" for male
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've chased your quarry from the tragedies they left behind in the core of"
" civilized space; all the way out here to the fringes of inhabited space.  "
"You caught up with their ship here in the Salus system, and heavily damaged "
"it.  But the combat didn't leave your ship unscathed.  Opportunistic "
"scavengers or pirates, you don't know which, ambushed you as you were "
"harrying your mark's ship and forcing it to ground.  You know your quarry "
"have crash landed somewhere on this planet but your ship, Truth and "
"Reconciliation, will never fly again.  You won't even walk away from this "
"icy wreck if you can't destroy the squad of drones and scavenger bots that "
"have dropped in to finish you off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "One Last Dance on the Ice" for female
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've chased your quarry from the tragedies they left behind in the core of"
" civilized space; all the way out here to the fringes of inhabited space.  "
"You caught up with their ship here in the Salus system, and heavily damaged "
"it.  But the combat didn't leave your ship unscathed.  Opportunistic "
"scavengers or pirates, you don't know which, ambushed you as you were "
"harrying your mark's ship and forcing it to ground.  You know your quarry "
"have crash landed somewhere on this planet but your ship, Truth and "
"Reconciliation, will never fly again.  You won't even walk away from this "
"icy wreck if you can't destroy the squad of drones and scavenger bots that "
"have dropped in to finish you off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Emergency Evacuation" for male
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You must have hit your head when the first explosion happened.  You sit up "
"and realize everyone is gone, the air smells like smoke, and that the ship's"
" computer is calmly announcing in its posh English voice: \"Abandon vessel "
"immediately, seven minutes to atmospheric entry.  Abandon vessel "
"immediately…\" Time to grab what you can and find an escape pod."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Emergency Evacuation" for female
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You must have hit your head when the first explosion happened.  You sit up "
"and realize everyone is gone, the air smells like smoke, and that the ship's"
" computer is calmly announcing in its posh English voice: \"Abandon vessel "
"immediately, seven minutes to atmospheric entry.  Abandon vessel "
"immediately…\" Time to grab what you can and find an escape pod."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Esper" for male
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"There are stories that before the Discontinuity, scientists had developed secret treatments unlock the powers of the human mind.  To read thoughts, move objects at a distance, control computers by the power of will alone, were just a few of the rumored abilities that laid dormant and at the edge of human potential.  But all knowledge of these treatments was lost when the Discontinuity shattered interstellar civilization.\n"
"\n"
"Or so you thought, until you had heard some tantalizing rumors about espers, centered on a backwater planet on the edge of known civilization.  You remember buying passage to the Salus system, arriving at Port Augustmoon, buying supplies, and descending to the surface, but after that things get hazy…  You're not entirely sure where you are, and you've clearly been through it, but somehow you've rediscovered that lost secret.  Now you just need to make it back alive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Esper" for female
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"There are stories that before the Discontinuity, scientists had developed secret treatments unlock the powers of the human mind.  To read thoughts, move objects at a distance, control computers by the power of will alone, were just a few of the rumored abilities that laid dormant and at the edge of human potential.  But all knowledge of these treatments was lost when the Discontinuity shattered interstellar civilization.\n"
"\n"
"Or so you thought, until you had heard some tantalizing rumors about espers, centered on a backwater planet on the edge of known civilization.  You remember buying passage to the Salus system, arriving at Port Augustmoon, buying supplies, and descending to the surface, but after that things get hazy…  You're not entirely sure where you are, and you've clearly been through it, but somehow you've rediscovered that lost secret.  Now you just need to make it back alive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Stranded Spacer" for male
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"What was to be a routine cargo transfer ended in tragedy when, in a brief "
"moment of chaos, your space ship was intercepted and destroyed by a StO "
"missile.  As soon as the MAW alarm flared to life, you scrambled to the "
"nearest escape pod and barely managed reach the uncertain safety of the "
"planet below."
msgstr ""

